Did they talk?

299
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,320
They probably didn't interact much.

300
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,060
I remember at that time...

301
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,840
After the dance competition,

302
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,920
the performers were getting
ready to head back.

303
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,440
Suddenly, we were notified

304
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,040
to stay

305
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,800
for the celebration banquet.

306
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,040
Contestants,

307
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,880
let's give a warm round of applause

308
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:34,080
to welcome the Chairman of Wending Group,

309
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,280
the renowned entrepreneur,

310
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,320
Mr. Gao Yuhai.

311
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:40,000
Great!

312
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,560
Hello, Mr. Gao.

313
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,200
Mr. Mu.

314
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:47,760
Hello, I've heard so much about you.

315
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:50,240
Thank you for coming in person
despite your busy schedule.

316
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:50,800
Please, have a seat.

317
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:52,600
Alright, everyone, please sit.

318
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:01,920
To all the young, promising,

319
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:05,920
and energetic future dancers,

320
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,000
hello.

321
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:10,600
I'm so happy to see you all.

322
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,360
As soon as I sat down,

323
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,960
I felt

324
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,600
the color and radiance of youth,

325
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,160
as well as the vitality

326
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,720
and passion of the young.

327
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,200
I instantly felt

328
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,080
10 or 20 years younger.

329
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:27,960
Thank you, Mr. Gao,

330
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:30,440
for sponsoring our dance competition.

331
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,480
My pleasure.

332
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,760
Mr. Gao is forever young,

333
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:34,800
right?

334
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,160
Right.

335
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:38,800
Alright, let's give it up for Mr. Gao.

336
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,200
Thank you.

